file/SiteAssets/Promotion/2026/03/27/1080x1620_300%20v2.jpg?v=12de9d9cba1c41f5ec4ba41d7691f96a","promotionImageUrlSc":"/linkweb/api/file/SiteAssets/Promotion/2026/03/27/1080x1620_300%20v2.jpg?v=12de9d9cba1c41f5ec4ba41d7691f96a"}],"mallDescription":{"descriptionTitleEn":"","descriptionTitleTc":"","descriptionTitleSc":"","descriptionContentEn":"Located near Lam Tin MTR station, Kai Tin Shopping Centre is a convenient hub for residents of Kai Tin and Ping Tin Estates as well as other nearby residents. With shops, restaurants, supermarkets, fresh market as well as other services, Kai Tin Shopping Centre fulfills every need. For added convenience, there are 460 parking spaces.\n\nKai Tin Shopping Centre offers an incredibly diverse shopping and dining destination. In addition, it houses all the services residents need in one convenient location.\n\n","descriptionContentTc":"鄰近藍田地鐵站的啟田商場，為平田邨和附近私人樓宇，如麗港城、匯景花園的居民提供一站式購物消閒選擇。內設商店、食肆、超級市場、鮮活街市和其它服務，店舖林立，滿足您的日常需要。商場更有460個泊車位，令購物更加方便。\n\n啟田商場位置方便，為居民一站式服務，提供多元化的購物和餐飲選擇。\n\n","descriptionContentSc":"邻近蓝田地铁站的启田商场，为平田邨和附近私人楼宇，如丽港城、汇景花园的居民提供一站式购物消闲选择。内设商店、食肆、超级市场、鲜活街市和其它服务，店舖林立，满足您的日常需要。商场更有460个泊车位，令购物更加方便。\n\n启田商场位置方便，为居民一站式服务，提供多元化的购物和餐饮选择。\n\n"},"mallInfo":{"shopCentreId":21,"propertyTypeId":2,"addressLabelEn":"Address","addressLabelTc":"地址","addressLabelSc":"地址","addressEn":"Kai Tin Shopping Centre 50 Kai Tin Road Lam Tin,  Kwun Tong, Kowloon","addressTc":"九龍觀塘藍田啟田道50號啟田商場","addressSc":"九龙观塘蓝田启田道50号启田商场","customerHotLineLabelEn":"Customer Service Hotline","customerHotLineLabelTc":"客戶服務熱線","customerHotLineLabelSc":"客户服务热线","customerHotLine":"(852) 2727 0591","carParkEnquiryLabelEn":"Car Park Enquiry","carParkEnquiryLabelTc":"停車場查詢","carParkEnquiryLabelSc":"停车场查询","carParkEnquiry":"5487 7944","leasingEnquiryLabelEn":"Leasing Enquiry","leasingEnquiryLabelTc":"租務查詢","leasingEnquiryLabelSc":"租务查询","leasingEnquiry":"(852) 2175 1375","websiteUrlLabelEn":"","websiteUrlLabelTc":"","websiteUrlLabelSc":"","websiteUrl":"","field02En":"","